<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Delete Account &amp; Data — Educational Times</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #0A1D4E;
      --royal: #1E40AF;
      --bg: #F8FAFC;
      --surface: #FFFFFF;
      --text: #0F172A;
      --muted: #475569;
      --border: #E2E8F0;
      --accent-bg: #EFF6FF;
      --accent-fg: #1D4ED8;
      --danger-bg: #FEF2F2;
      --danger-fg: #991B1B;
      --danger-border: #FECACA;
      --ok-bg: #ECFDF5;
      --ok-fg: #065F46;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #0B1120;
        --surface: #111827;
        --text: #F1F5F9;
        --muted: #94A3B8;
        --border: #1E293B;
        --accent-bg: #172554;
        --accent-fg: #93C5FD;
        --danger-bg: #450A0A;
        --danger-fg: #FCA5A5;
        --danger-border: #7F1D1D;
        --ok-bg: #064E3B;
        --ok-fg: #A7F3D0;
      }
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--royal));
      color: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 40px 20px 36px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header .brand {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 1.9rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    header p {
      margin: 0;
      opacity: 0.9;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: -20px auto 48px;
      padding: 0 16px;
    }

    section {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    p {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    ol, ul {
      margin: 8px 0 10px 22px;
      padding: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .callout-danger {
      background: var(--danger-bg);
      color: var(--danger-fg);
      border: 1px solid var(--danger-border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .callout-ok {
      background: var(--ok-bg);
      color: var(--ok-fg);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    input, textarea, select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    button {
      background: var(--royal);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover {
      opacity: 0.92;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent-fg);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 12px 16px 32px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">Educational Times</div>
    <h1>Account &amp; Data Deletion</h1>
    <p>App ID: <code>com.aistudio.educationaltimes.etkmpq</code> &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Developer: Educational Times Editorial &amp; Engineering Team</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <h2>Option 1: Delete Your Account Directly Inside the App (Recommended)</h2>
      <p>If you still have the <strong>Educational Times</strong> Android app installed, you can submit an immediate deletion request directly from your account:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Open the <strong>Educational Times</strong> app and sign in to your account.</li>
        <li>Tap the <strong>Profile</strong> tab in the bottom navigation bar.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>App Settings &amp; About</strong>.</li>
        <li>Scroll to the <strong>Account &amp; Privacy</strong> section and tap <strong>Delete My Account</strong>.</li>
        <li>Confirm your request. Your account is immediately scheduled for permanent deletion and signed out.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Option 2: Request Account Deletion Online (Without the App)</h2>
      <p>
        If you have uninstalled the app or cannot sign in, parents, guardians, students, teachers, and contributors
        can request permanent deletion of their <strong>Educational Times</strong> account and associated personal data
        using the form below or by emailing
        <a href="mailto:support@educationaltimes.org?subject=Account%20Deletion%20Request%20-%20Educational%20Times">support@educationaltimes.org</a>.
      </p>

      <form id="deleteForm" onsubmit="return openDeletionEmail(event)">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Registered Account Email Address *</label>
          <input id="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="accountType">Account Role / Requestor</label>
          <select id="accountType">
            <option value="Student / Learner">Student / Learner</option>
            <option value="Parent or Legal Guardian (Under-18 Account)">Parent or Legal Guardian (Under-18 Account)</option>
            <option value="Teacher / Educator">Teacher / Educator</option>
            <option value="Contributor">Contributor</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="reason">Optional Notes or Specific Data to Remove</label>
          <textarea id="reason" rows="3" placeholder="Optional: specify whether you want full account deletion or only selected data removed."></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit">Submit Account Deletion Request via Email</button>
      </form>

      <div class="callout-ok">
        We verify account ownership (or parent/guardian identity for under-18 student accounts) and complete deletion requests within <strong>7 business days</strong> (and no later than 30 days).
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What Data Is Deleted vs. Retained</h2>
      <h3>Data Permanently Deleted</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Authentication credentials and active sessions (Supabase Auth record and Google Sign-In link).</li>
        <li>Personal profile data: full name, email address, optional mobile number, date of birth, age category, class/standard, school/institution, district, state, bio, designation, and social links.</li>
        <li>Uploaded profile avatar images and unpublished contributor drafts.</li>
        <li>Personal activity records: saved bookmarks, likes, poll votes, quiz attempts, and in-app notification records.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Data Retained Temporarily or Anonymized</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Security &amp; Child-Safety Audit Logs:</strong> Minimal abuse/safety report logs required for legal compliance, child safety, or fraud prevention may be retained securely for up to <strong>30 days</strong> before permanent purge.</li>
        <li><strong>Aggregate Counts:</strong> Non-personal, anonymized aggregate statistics (such as anonymous post view counts) do not identify you and cannot be linked back to your deleted account.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="callout-danger">
        <strong>Note on Google Play Subscriptions:</strong> Deleting your Educational Times account does not automatically cancel an active Google Play subscription. To stop future billing, cancel any active contributor subscription in <strong>Google Play Store &rarr; Payments &amp; subscriptions &rarr; Subscriptions</strong>.
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 Educational Times. &nbsp;|&nbsp;
    <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
    Contact: <a href="mailto:support@educationaltimes.org">support@educationaltimes.org</a>
  </footer>

  <script>
    function openDeletionEmail(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      var email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      var role = document.getElementById('accountType').value;
      var notes = document.getElementById('reason').value.trim();
      var subject = encodeURIComponent('Account Deletion Request - Educational Times');
      var body = encodeURIComponent(
        'Please permanently delete my Educational Times account and associated personal data.\n\n' +
        'Registered Email: ' + email + '\n' +
        'Account Type / Requestor: ' + role + '\n' +
        (notes ? 'Notes: ' + notes + '\n' : '') +
        '\nApp ID: com.aistudio.educationaltimes.etkmpq'
      );
      window.location.href = 'mailto:support@educationaltimes.org?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
      return false;
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
